    "question": "James buys 3 CDs.  Two of them are 1.5 hours each.  The last one is twice that long.  What is the combined length of the CDs?",
    "gold": "6",
    "answer": "The long CD is 1.5*2=<<1.5*2=3>>3 hours\nThe two shorter CDs have a combined length of 1.5*2=<<1.5*2=3>>3 hours\nSo in total the CDs had a length of 3+3= <<3+3=6>>6 hours\n#### 6"
